      "question": "Can cosine embedding retrievers keep the default merge threshold?",
      "answer": "No. Cosine similarity runs hotter than Jaccard; raise merge_threshold to roughly 0.85 or unrelated entries will consolidate.",
      "kind": "explicit",
      "sources": [
        "readme-retrieval"
      ],
      "energy": -3.191891195797325e-16,
